        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a Haunted house full of ghostly shenanigans and spooky jump scares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a top G ghost hunter and you must capture all the ghostly anomalies that terrorize this luxurious home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are a professional ghost hunter from a ghost hunting team called : &quot;The Swimming Turtle Ghost Hunters&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your objective is to capture all ghostly anomalies that are terrorizing the house dweller named: &quot;Napoleon Pascal&quot; in his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Things get increasingly more bizarre as you visit the house every single night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must record all paranormal activity before time runs out or else you will come face to face with a rather cute but extremely dangerous ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However throughout your ghostly adventures, you discover that napoleon is someone who isn't exactly mentally stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are these hauntings even real or are they delusions of napoleons mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple First person survival horror where you record paranormal anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric spooky ambiance that will fill you with dread and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ghostly enemies that will occasionally chase you throughout your ghost hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-As you explore the house, you will encounter all sorts crazy weird spooky scares and anomalies that will leave you frightened but leave you laughing like a braying donkey choking on water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A genuinely unique take on the VHS/analog horror sub genre with a comedic twist.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a Haunted house full of ghostly shenanigans and spooky jump scares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a top G ghost hunter and you must capture all the ghostly anomalies that terrorize this luxurious home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are a professional ghost hunter from a ghost hunting team called : &quot;The Swimming Turtle Ghost Hunters&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your objective is to capture all ghostly anomalies that are terrorizing the house dweller named: &quot;Napoleon Pascal&quot; in his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Things get increasingly more bizarre as you visit the house every single night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must record all paranormal activity before time runs out or else you will come face to face with a rather cute but extremely dangerous ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However throughout your ghostly adventures, you discover that napoleon is someone who isn't exactly mentally stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are these hauntings even real or are they delusions of napoleons mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple First person survival horror where you record paranormal anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric spooky ambiance that will fill you with dread and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ghostly enemies that will occasionally chase you throughout your ghost hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-As you explore the house, you will encounter all sorts crazy weird spooky scares and anomalies that will leave you frightened but leave you laughing like a braying donkey choking on water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A genuinely unique take on the VHS/analog horror sub genre with a comedic twist.</p>",
